{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/07cd46b80e476ecf6d5ebe7ccbf94817.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Septura \u2014 an alien world where intellect is currency, knowledge is power, and absurdity lurks around every corner. Septurian Might is a <strong>2D platforming ARPG</strong> with tight, demanding combat, a branching emotional story, and a lore-rich universe filled with both wonder and laugh-out-loud moments. Its defining twist: <strong>steal the intellect of your enemies to claim their abilities</strong>, and adapt those powers to survive Septura\u2019s toughest \u2014 and often funniest \u2014 battles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/06218ad41df6a9b599b63d89a23f6912.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master punishing yet rewarding <strong>souls-like combat</strong>, where every swing matters, every mistake stings, and victory feels earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/1124461cfa2ecfb4b96fe74f8fdba28e.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every foe you face is more than a challenge\u2014they\u2019re a <strong>vessel</strong>, their <strong>intellect</strong>, <strong>memories</strong>, and <strong>powers</strong> yours to <strong>steal</strong> and make your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/173221d28b27eddfa3922324edd1f287.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span>Confront over <strong>100 enemies </strong>and<strong> 30 bosses</strong>, each brimming with personality \u2014 from mischievous critters to towering beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/0aea9f40cc7b715251f60f501454ff1b.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal <strong>100+ tactical and offensive abilities</strong> directly from your foes, transforming their strengths into your survival tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/64bc01a38edce5d9a6014809ad4bd366.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend stolen intellect to unlock and upgrade over <strong>25 unique skills</strong> across five sprawling trees, shaping your playstyle and long-term growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/4b23a81962e4d89bb09aa73db82964bf.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character with <strong>skills</strong>, <strong>abilities</strong>, and <strong>gadgets</strong> to grow as smart (and deadly) as you can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/bc0f15ea534f287bccc19def1baa14bb.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stitch together <strong>stolen memories</strong> to unlock<strong> hidden quests</strong>, secret dialogues, and deeper insights into Septura\u2019s lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/c21b7d90cf7c21700715124a0da2daae.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant, <strong>side-scrolling</strong> alien landscapes, bursting with color, lore, <strong>platforming challenges</strong>, and <strong>puzzles</strong> that test both wit and reflex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/extras/8c30d39fba8aedacf50fff037c1369c0.avif?t=1761163379\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter \u2013 <strong>every decision</strong> reshapes the world, branching your journey into <strong>multiple endings</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753240?t=1761163379","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753240?t=1761163379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/7c4453e4e4095057142bbcaaf5cc02e6137d1b17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761163379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753240/7c4453e4e4095057142bbcaaf5cc02e6137d1b17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761163379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati